{"question": {"title": "二分查找：有序数组中首次出现的目标索引", "content": "## 题目描述\n\n返回 target 第一次出现的零起始索引；不存在返回 -1。nums 非递减，允许重复，空数组返回 -1。必须使用 O(log n) 查找。\n\n## 数据范围\n\n数组长度为0至200，元素在[-100,100]。target 在[-101,101]。\n\n核心代码模式实现指定 Solution 方法，无需处理输入输出。所有结果都是确定的，不允许返回任意一个可行答案。\n\n\n## ACM 输入与输出约定\n\n参数按函数签名顺序读取。标量每值一行；字符串整行读取，可为空但不含换行；数组或列表先读取长度，再逐项读取；矩阵递归按数组读取，每行先给出长度；链表和二叉树先读取序列长度，随后每项一行，二叉树采用层序并用 null 表示空节点，-1 表示空链表或空树。输出按返回类型采用相同规则，布尔值为 true/false，double 使用小数点后 16 位的科学计数法（例如 1.0000000000000000e+00）。核心代码模式按下方函数签名返回结果。\n", "judgeConfig": {"timeLimit": 2000, "memoryLimit": 262144, "outputLimitBytes": 1048576}, "problemSpec": {"mode": "function", "className": "Solution", "methodName": "firstIndex", "parameters": [{"name": "nums", "type": "int[]"}, {"name": "target", "type": "int"}], "returnType": "int", "resultSource": "return", "comparator": {"type": "EXACT", "epsilon": null}, "harnessVersion": 1, "judgeCases": [{"input": "{\"nums\":[],\"target\":101}", "output": "null", "isHidden": false}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[0,0,0,0],\"target\":0}", "output": "null", "isHidden": false}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[-47,0],\"target\":0}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[-95,-69,-49,77],\"target\":101}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[-75,-54,-41,-13,31,59,72,100],\"target\":31}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[],\"target\":101}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[0,0,0,0],\"target\":101}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[-92],\"target\":-92}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[31,77],\"target\":77}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[-20,50,56,82],\"target\":101}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[],\"target\":101}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[0,0,0,0],\"target\":0}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[77],\"target\":101}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[46],\"target\":46}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[6,60],\"target\":60}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[],\"target\":101}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[0,0,0,0],\"target\":0}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[-90,-86,-74,-59,-26,-22,-13,-8,13,25,27,35,50,52,58,59,71,77,93,97],\"target\":27}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[93],\"target\":101}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "{\"nums\":[-29],\"target\":-29}", "output": "null", "isHidden": true}]}, "judgeCase": [{"input": "0\n101\n", "output": "", "isHidden": false}, {"input": "4\n0\n0\n0\n0\n0\n", "output": "", "isHidden": false}, {"input": "2\n-47\n0\n0\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "4\n-95\n-69\n-49\n77\n101\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "8\n-75\n-54\n-41\n-13\n31\n59\n72\n100\n31\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "0\n101\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "4\n0\n0\n0\n0\n101\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "1\n-92\n-92\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "2\n31\n77\n77\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "4\n-20\n50\n56\n82\n101\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "0\n101\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "4\n0\n0\n0\n0\n0\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "1\n77\n101\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "1\n46\n46\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "2\n6\n60\n60\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "0\n101\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "4\n0\n0\n0\n0\n0\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "20\n-90\n-86\n-74\n-59\n-26\n-22\n-13\n-8\n13\n25\n27\n35\n50\n52\n58\n59\n71\n77\n93\n97\n27\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "1\n93\n101\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}, {"input": "1\n-29\n-29\n", "output": "", "isHidden": true}]}, "referenceSolutions": {"python:FUNCTION": "class Solution:\n    def firstIndex(self, nums, target):\n        l,r=0,len(nums)\n        while l<r:\n         mid=(l+r)//2\n         if nums[mid]<target: l=mid+1\n         else: r=mid\n        return l if l<len(nums) and nums[l]==target else -1\n", "java:FUNCTION": "import java.util.*;\nclass Solution { public int firstIndex(int[] nums,int target) {int l=0,r=nums.length;while(l<r){int mid=l+(r-l)/2;if(nums[mid]<target)l=mid+1;else r=mid;}return l<nums.length&&nums[l]==target?l:-1;} }", "cpp:FUNCTION": "#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\nclass Solution { public: int firstIndex(vector<int> nums,int target) {int l=0,r=nums.size();while(l<r){int mid=l+(r-l)/2;if(nums[mid]<target)l=mid+1;else r=mid;}return l<(int)nums.size()&&nums[l]==target?l:-1;} };"}, "generationProtocol": "CANONICAL_LINES_V1", "oracleSolution": "class Solution:\n    def firstIndex(self, nums, target):\n        for i,x in enumerate(nums):\n         if x==target: return i\n        return -1\n", "templateId": "binary_first", "templateVersion": "trusted-v1"}